These XML Schema Definitions and accompanying documentation (the "Schemas")
describe interfaces and payload formats used by TransactionTree's commercial
services, including the C360 (formerly BORMC — Business Office Receipt
Management Center) loyalty API and the TransactionTree Digital Receipt
(TTDR / VRG) ingest pipeline.

The Schemas are published to assist customers, partners, and integrators
implementing client-side code against TransactionTree services under an
applicable subscription, SOW, or integration agreement. Permission is hereby
granted to such parties to:

  - read, copy, and reference the Schemas for the purpose of generating
    or validating XML payloads exchanged with TransactionTree services;
  - redistribute the Schemas verbatim alongside such integrations, provided
    this notice is preserved.

